.el .ds Aq '
.TH urlmenu-explain 1  "explain " 
.SH NAME
urlmenu\-explain \- Show how a URL is cleaned, which rule or picker handles it, and its history; a fragment such as `github` lists every matching site
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBurlmenu explain\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIURL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show how a URL is cleaned, which rule or picker handles it, and its history; a fragment such as `github` lists every matching site
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print what would run as JSON instead of running it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIURL\fR>

